  IsTutorial: 1
  TutorialSteps:
  - TopText: Welcome to Blobber! The goal of the game is to clear all blobs off the
      board. You can clear a blob by merging it into another one of a different color
      as long as they are on a shared row or column.
    BottomText: Try merging that pink blob into the blue one.
    StartX: 0
    StartY: 2
    EndX: 2
    EndY: 2
  - TopText: "See that flag pole? That's a Target blob. A regular blob that sits
      on top of it will clear and win the level\u2014but only when it's the last
      one on the board and matches the target's color."
    BottomText: Glide your last blob into the target to finish it off!
    StartX: 2
    StartY: 2
    EndX: 2
    EndY: 0
  Blobs:
